{"id": "33980", "title": "紫贝壳", "author": "琼瑶", "category": "文学名著", "count": 21, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33980.htm", "intro": "月色如银，碧波荡漾，梦轩紧握住手中的紫贝壳，正如他强烈要给佩青所有的爱。但纵使佩青如此攫掳他心，他也无权利破坏妻子美婵的安宁，及自己心爱的儿女小枫小竹的幸福.....。", "base": "files/article/html/33/33980", "chapters": [{"title": "第1节", "file": "2160474.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2节", "file": "2160475.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3节", "file": "2160476.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4节", "file": "2160477.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5节", "file": "2160478.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6节", "file": "2160479.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7节", "file": "2160480.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8节", "file": "2160481.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9节", "file": "2160482.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10节", "file": "2160483.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11节", "file": "2160484.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12节", "file": "2160485.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13节", "file": "2160486.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14节", "file": "2160487.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15节", "file": "2160488.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16节", "file": "2160489.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17节", "file": "2160490.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18节", "file": "2160491.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19节", "file": "2160492.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20节", "file": "2160493.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21节", "file": "2160494.html", "available": false}]}